          <a href="https://www.peoplematters.in/news/strategic-hr/entry-level-hiring-climbs-168percent-as-ai-roles-and-internships-gain-ground-linkedin-49290" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">People Matters: LinkedIn Grad's Guide 2026 coverage</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          LinkedIn's own help center guidance on setting Open to Work visibility to recruiters versus all members.
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/help/linkedin/answer/a566483" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn Help: Open to Work</a>
        </li>
        <li>
