          <a href="https://resumeworded.com/linkedin-review/linkedin-headline-examples-for-students" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Resume Worded: LinkedIn headline examples for students</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="faqs" class="container section faq-block">
